  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Punjab Education Foundation (PEF) to improve access to and quality of education in Punjab&#x2019;s low fee private school sector with focus on girls and the most marginalized, with 50% of the beneficiaries under the project being girls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the Punjab Education Foundation (PEF) to improve access to and quality of education in Punjab&#x2019;s low fee private school sector with focus on girls and the most marginalized, with 50% of the beneficiaries under the project being girls is a component of Punjab Education Support Programme II reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;84,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Primary education, Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322).</narrative>
  </description>
